            {
              "text": "揚げ足の例文",
              "source": "幻辞"
            },
            {
              "text": "取引開始直後から揚げ足がつき、午前中に株価が三パーセント上昇した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "前日比プラスで始まり、揚げ足のまま大引けを迎えた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "sitting cross-legged",
        "register": "standard",
